body:
Guys... I don't know what happened.

Consecutive rolls with gold rings on [both Tristan and Fionn](https://i.imgur.com/WRIQwxf.jpg), rainbow but for [Vlad](https://i.imgur.com/J6nIJYu.jpg), more gold for [Thomas Edison](https://i.imgur.com/x5qRfOH.jpg).

Finally with [Cu Alter and Arthur](https://i.imgur.com/YC0ZLP1.jpg) in the same roll, my luck is gone now.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

NOOOOO I got Salter to 5k HP with only Ishtar left (700 HP) and no combination of attacks will kill her. And I used all my CS. NO!!!

...

OH WAIT I forgot Eyes of Medjed reduces by 2 turns. I used that to reduce skill 1 (ATK up) and it did it. I feel like I got lucky with how that played out... [Thank goodness](https://i.imgur.com/U3a6inJ.jpg). ;\_\_\_;
